Redraw only the changed cells after a synchronized update instead of whole
lines; one changed cell on a 200-column RGB line took 6977 bytes per frame.
Upstream pull request, not merged yet:
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/pull/5758
commits 64fbe9c9, 0e22529c, c0fbac92, adcd1d42; redraw_cb keeps the
one-argument signature tmux 3.8 has.

